<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1344830378"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1544694587"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="リバイブ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="UNIONE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="リバイブ"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:30.277"><div begin="00:11.457" end="04:31.324"><p begin="00:11.457" end="00:15.661" itunes:key="L63993">終わらない夜に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽的长夜里 你的声音在耳边响起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ra na i yo ru ni ki mi no ko e ki ko e ta</span></p><p begin="00:16.550" end="00:20.176" itunes:key="L63994">君の声 聞こえた</p><p begin="00:21.247" end="00:30.065" itunes:key="L63995">目覚めた朝を包み込んでくれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将觉醒的清晨 也一并拥入怀里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me za me ta a sa wo tsu tsu mi ko n de ku re ta</span></p><p begin="00:30.475" end="00:34.582" itunes:key="L63996">失ったものの多さに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失去的东西越来越多</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u shi na 't ta mo no no o o sa ni</span></p><p begin="00:35.407" end="00:39.929" itunes:key="L63997">立ちすくむ事もあるけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时也让我望而却步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta chi su ku mu ko to mo a ru ke do</span></p><p begin="00:40.341" end="00:48.657" itunes:key="L63998">それでも立ち上がることだけが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我依旧会迎难而上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ta chi a ga ru ko to da ke ga</span></p><p begin="00:48.928" end="00:54.503" itunes:key="L63999">君とした約束<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为那是我们之间的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi to shi ta ya ku so ku</span></p><p begin="00:55.161" end="00:56.211" itunes:key="L64000">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 辗转邂逅的所有一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive me gu ri a e ta su be te ga</span></p><p begin="00:56.383" end="01:00.382" itunes:key="L64001">巡り逢えた全てが<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive me gu ri a e ta su be te ga</span></p><p begin="01:00.092" end="01:01.312" itunes:key="L64002">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 存活在我的心跳之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ko do u no na ka de i ki te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:01.322" end="01:05.026" itunes:key="L64003">鼓動の中で生きている<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ko do u no na ka de i ki te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:05.036" end="01:08.915" itunes:key="L64004">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 不再迷茫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive mo u ma yo wa na i</span></p><p begin="01:09.025" end="01:13.205" itunes:key="L64005">もう迷わない</p><p begin="01:14.946" end="01:16.129" itunes:key="L64006">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 紧紧相系的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive tsu na ga 't te i ku o mo i ga</span></p><p begin="01:16.139" end="01:19.732" itunes:key="L64007">繋がってく想いが<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive tsu na ga 't te i ku o mo i ga</span></p><p begin="01:18.611" end="01:20.324" itunes:key="L78344">（想いが）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive  点燃坚定的火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive yu ru gi na i hi wo mo ya su yo</span></p><p begin="01:19.946" end="01:20.970" itunes:key="L64008">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 点燃坚定的火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive yu ru gi na i hi wo mo ya su yo</span></p><p begin="01:21.180" end="01:24.651" itunes:key="L64009">揺るぎない火を燃やすよ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive yu ru gi na i hi wo mo ya su yo</span></p><p begin="01:23.657" end="01:25.385" itunes:key="L80095">（燃やすよ）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive Revive Revive  此刻复苏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive i ma yo mi ga e ru</span></p><p begin="01:24.835" end="01:28.468" itunes:key="L64010">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 此刻复苏醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive i ma yo mi ga e ru</span></p><p begin="01:28.896" end="01:32.834" itunes:key="L64011">今蘇る</p><p begin="01:33.510" end="01:35.176" itunes:key="L64012">明日へREVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着明天 revive</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta he revive</span></p><p begin="01:35.664" end="01:44.736" itunes:key="L64013">Wow...promise you, I promise you!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">答应你 我答应你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Wow promise you I promise you</span></p><p begin="01:45.463" end="01:49.932" itunes:key="L64014">終わらない夜は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽的长夜里 想起过往点滴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa ra na i yo ru ha o mo i de wo na zo 't te</span></p><p begin="01:50.590" end="01:54.406" itunes:key="L15779">思い出をなぞって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描摹回忆的点滴</span></p><p begin="01:53.324" end="01:54.964" itunes:key="L82761">（なぞって）</p><p begin="01:55.315" end="01:59.898" itunes:key="L64015">いつからこんなに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知不觉间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ra ko n na ni</span></p><p begin="02:00.376" end="02:04.494" itunes:key="L17022">涙が出るのだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">泪水止不住的夺眶而出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da ga de ru no da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:04.504" end="02:08.773" itunes:key="L64016">守りたいもの全てを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri ta i mo no su be te wo</span></p><p begin="02:09.407" end="02:14.060" itunes:key="L64017">抱き締めることは出来ない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要守护的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ki shi me ru ko to ha de ki na i</span></p><p begin="02:14.347" end="02:17.167" itunes:key="L64018">分かってはいるけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法全部拥入怀中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ha i ru ke do</span></p><p begin="02:17.177" end="02:22.819" itunes:key="L64019">どうか君だけは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我唯独希望你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka ki mi da ke ha</span></p><p begin="02:23.019" end="02:28.606" itunes:key="L64020">笑っていてと願う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你能一直微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra 't te i te to ne ga u</span></p><p begin="02:29.171" end="02:30.357" itunes:key="L64021">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 所以今天我依然在此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive da ka ra kyo u mo ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="02:30.415" end="02:34.014" itunes:key="L64022">だから今日もここにいる<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive da ka ra kyo u mo ko ko ni i ru</span></p><p begin="02:34.185" end="02:35.246" itunes:key="L64023">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 为你献唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ki mi he mu ke te u ta u yo</span></p><p begin="02:35.361" end="02:39.114" itunes:key="L64024">君へ向けて歌うよ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ki mi he mu ke te u ta u yo</span></p><p begin="02:39.124" end="02:42.752" itunes:key="L64025">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 终于察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive ya 't to ki du i ta yo</span></p><p begin="02:43.084" end="02:47.159" itunes:key="L64026">やっと気づいたよ</p><p begin="02:48.977" end="02:50.129" itunes:key="L64027">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 紧紧相系的思念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive tsu na ga 't te i ku o mo i ga</span></p><p begin="02:50.193" end="02:53.702" itunes:key="L64028">繋がってく想いが<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive tsu na ga 't te i ku o mo i ga</span></p><p begin="02:52.700" end="02:54.386" itunes:key="L85006">（想いが）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 点燃温暖的火焰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive a ta ta ka i hi wo mo ya su yo</span></p><p begin="02:53.889" end="02:55.012" itunes:key="L64029">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive a ta ta ka i hi wo mo ya su yo</span></p><p begin="02:55.199" end="02:58.952" itunes:key="L64030">暖かい火を燃やすよ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive a ta ta ka i hi wo mo ya su yo</span></p><p begin="02:57.614" end="02:59.535" itunes:key="L85409">（燃やすよ）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 永远不会湮灭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive ki e ru ko to no na i</span></p><p begin="02:58.892" end="03:02.491" itunes:key="L64031">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive ki e ru ko to no na i</span></p><p begin="03:02.886" end="03:06.966" itunes:key="L64032">消えることのない</p><p begin="03:07.578" end="03:09.233" itunes:key="L64033">永遠の REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永恒的 revive</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e i e n no revive</span></p><p begin="03:09.633" end="03:11.895" itunes:key="L71947">We are one &amp; we are strong!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在一起  我们如此坚定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">We are one ＆ we are strong</span></p><p begin="03:11.905" end="03:14.672" itunes:key="L64034">誰も止められない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何人都无法阻止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo to me ra re na i</span></p><p begin="03:14.682" end="03:17.016" itunes:key="L72804">We are one &amp; we are strong!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在一起  我们如此坚定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">We are one ＆ we are strong</span></p><p begin="03:16.826" end="03:19.147" itunes:key="L64035">やっと目覚めたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya 't to me za me ta n da</span></p><p begin="03:19.136" end="03:24.134" itunes:key="L73177">Oh here we stand!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们就在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Oh here we stand</span></p><p begin="03:24.544" end="03:29.025" itunes:key="L64036">愛しているから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我深深的爱着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi te i ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:30.992" end="03:32.067" itunes:key="L64037">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 数千的繁星请为我见证</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive i ku se n no ho shi no ma e</span></p><p begin="03:32.325" end="03:35.640" itunes:key="L64038">幾千の星の前<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive i ku se n no ho shi no ma e</span></p><p begin="03:35.968" end="03:37.068" itunes:key="L64039">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 此刻我真心的许下誓言</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ta shi ka ni i ma chi ka u yo</span></p><p begin="03:37.278" end="03:40.671" itunes:key="L64040">確かに今誓うよ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ta shi ka ni i ma chi ka u yo</span></p><p begin="03:40.894" end="03:44.534" itunes:key="L64041">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 不再迷茫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive mo u ma yo wa na i</span></p><p begin="03:44.908" end="03:48.997" itunes:key="L64042">もう迷わない</p><p begin="03:49.644" end="03:55.063" itunes:key="L64043">信じてREVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请相信我 revive</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji te revive</span></p><p begin="04:00.725" end="04:04.280" itunes:key="L64044">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 终于察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive ya 't to ki du i ta yo</span></p><p begin="04:04.790" end="04:08.786" itunes:key="L64045">やっと気づいたよ</p><p begin="04:10.583" end="04:11.590" itunes:key="L64046">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 辗转邂逅的所有一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive me gu ri a e ta su be te ga</span></p><p begin="04:11.825" end="04:15.395" itunes:key="L64047">巡り会えたすべてが<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive me gu ri a e ta su be te ga</span></p><p begin="04:15.505" end="04:16.573" itunes:key="L64048">REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive 存活在我的心跳之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ko do u no na ka de i ki te i ru</span></p><p begin="04:16.790" end="04:20.442" itunes:key="L64049">鼓動の中で生きている<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive ko do u no na ka de i ki te i ru</span></p><p begin="04:20.536" end="04:24.160" itunes:key="L64050">REVIVE, REVIVE, REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Revive revive revive 来吧 伸出手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Revive revive revive sa a te wo no ba shi te</span></p><p begin="04:24.481" end="04:28.527" itunes:key="L64051">さあ手を伸ばして</p><p begin="04:29.241" end="04:31.324" itunes:key="L64052">明日へ REVIVE<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着明天 revive</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta he revive</span></p></div></body></tt>